  "type": "Manifest",
  "label": {
    "en": [
      "An old postal tag made of wood with a wax seal and string, featuring a printed label in French. The label mentions 'Administration des Postes de Hongrie' and references routes between Budapest, Parkan-Nána, Parkan, and Bratislava. There is a postal stamp dated Feb 25. The tag seems to be used for administrative or logistical postal purposes rather than as a typical postcard."
    ]
